# Production build-time configuration for the Vite frontend.
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL must be present when `vite build` runs: Vite inlines it into
# the bundle, so a value supplied after the build has no effect. Without it the
# client falls back to "/api" (src/api/client.ts), which under the SPA rewrite in
# vercel.json resolves to index.html — the app then receives HTML where it
# expects JSON, and every request fails in a way that looks nothing like a
# misconfiguration.
#
# This is NOT a secret. It is a public hostname that ships inside the client
# JavaScript by definition, so it belongs in the repo rather than in a dashboard
# field where it can silently go missing. A Vercel environment variable of the
# same name still takes precedence if one is set.
#
# The /api suffix is required.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://tennisai-api.onrender.com/api
